        <mxCell id="note_ph1" value="Code Sheet &amp; Label Format (Sec 6.2):&#10;• Sheet Margin: Batch ID, allocation (farm or center reserve), print timestamp, operator ID, 'Sheet n of m'.&#10;• Each Label: QR code (https://&lt;lookup-host&gt;/s/XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXC), human Crockford Base32 code, 'Consulta del saco'.&#10;• Zero personal data, farm name, weight, or date printed on label! (A09 sec 8.1)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fefce8;strokeColor=#ca8a04;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#854d0e;fontSize=13;align=left;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
